      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1299817655,
      "version": 58,
      "versionNonce": 922043607,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790749238060,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "refreshPromise is a shared promise. If several\nrequests get 401 at about the same time, they all wait\nfor the same refresh request rather than each making\ntheir own.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "refreshPromise is a shared promise. If several requests get 401 at about the same time, they all wait for the same refresh request rather than each making their own.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8QHLLXvZM9gjtt8hTH3FT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 614.5,
      "y": 2219,
      "width": 671,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 509853751,
      "version": 52,
      "versionNonce": 1715654039,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790749265531,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Once refresh finishes, the promise is cleared so a\nfuture 401 can initiate another refresh.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Once refresh finishes, the promise is cleared so a future 401 can initiate another refresh.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pHSuZ-wZCFuPkkE77lU-v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 2338.5,
      "width": 412,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2002316793,
      "version": 19,
      "versionNonce": 81814103,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790749308447,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The original request is retried",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The original request is retried",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "j5NyodlTktcqoJU9MHPik",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 611,
      "y": 2415.5,
      "width": 718,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1789640793,
      "version": 45,
      "versionNonce": 2044802871,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790749322345,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "After refresh succeeds, the interceptor updates the\noriginal request’s Authorization header with the new\ntoken and sends that request again.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "After refresh succeeds, the interceptor updates the original request’s Authorization header with the new token and sends that request again.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "91pllPN04h2yBNoTTKZ3t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 608,
      "y": 2551,
      "width": 694,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 21455225,
      "version": 54,
      "versionNonce": 988831705,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790749349962,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The _retry flag prevents the same request from\nrepeatedly refreshing if its retry also receives 401.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The _retry flag prevents the same request from repeatedly refreshing if its retry also receives 401.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WCF_L36IG76EAQmDpdKs5",
      "type": "line",
      "x": 673,
      "y": 2586,
      "width": 88,
      "height": 2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1417346457,
      "version": 32,
      "versionNonce": 261928567,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790749355801,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "points": [
        [
          0,
          0
        ],
        [
          88,
          2
        ]
      ],
      "lastCommittedPoint": null,
      "startBinding": null,
      "endBinding": null,
      "startArrowhead": null,
      "endArrowhead": null
    },
    {
      "id": "syJhJxDgMxS16c0ywj8a-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 479.5,
      "y": 2677.5,
      "width": 527,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1338525241,
      "version": 32,
      "versionNonce": 1940534617,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790749368743,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If refresh fails, the user is logged out",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If refresh fails, the user is logged out",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QzsDpfLYRB1CoCqu_iQqL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 606,
      "y": 2752,
      "width": 722,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1070704633,
      "version": 21,
      "versionNonce": 1286069911,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790749381279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If the refresh request fails or returns an invalid\nresponse, the catch handler clears the Zustand auth\nstate with logout(). The original request is then\nrejected with the refresh error.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If the refresh request fails or returns an invalid response, the catch handler clears the Zustand auth state with logout(). The original request is then rejected with the refresh error.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
